        "text": "top of page\nDonate\nGilroy stands with Christina\n# ENDORSMENTS\n##### PROUDLY ENDORSED BY\n##### \"I walked away with an impression of someone ready to lead and ready to do her best to continue to build Gilroy into one of the finest cities in California. I am proud to stand right beside her.\"\nKen Christopher\nThird-Generation Gilroy Farmer\n\"Christina has never been someone to wait for permission to make a difference. She acts,\nshows up and pushes forward even when the path is steep. That is the strong determination that our City Leaders need. I wholeheartedly give my full support to Christina Tovar and her Campaign for\nCouncilwoman”\nFran Beaudet\nOwner, Old City Hall Restaurant\n\"Christina has deep roots in the Gilroy Community. Christina will breathe a new, more inclusive energy into the current council with her common sense, her courage to speak up, to challenge the status quo, with a willingness to listen and compromise without losing her sense of values or priorities. Christina is ready to lead.\"\nRachel & Dr. John Perez\n\"Christina Tovar brings the strategic vision and economic expertise our Gilroy City Council needs\".\nEvelia & Jaime Rosso\nRosso Furniture\n\"Christina Tovar is a good fit for Gilroy City Council. She has a strong, much needed personality and is willing to speak up\"\nThe Edward Boss Prado Foundation\nCecelia & Gary Ponzini\n\"Christina is a dedicated leader who genuinely cares about our community and is committed to making a positive difference for Gilroy.\"\nMaria Cid\nFarmer's Insurance\n\"Christina Tovar walks her talk every single day. She has already proven her commitment to Gilroy with decades of service and investment. This isn't a candidate posting stock photos months before an election. She is real, her words are truth and her intentions are backed up by doing the real work\".\nBusiness Owner/ Community Advocate\nAnn Marie McCauley\n\"As a Gilroy resident, I support Christina Tovar because she leads with heart, serves with purpose, and always puts our community first. Her values, leadership, financial skills, and commitment to positive change are exactly what District 5 needs\".\nCarlos Pineda\nGilroy Resident\n\"I am proud to endorse Christina Tovar for Gilroy City Council District 5 because I know firsthand the kind of leader she is. Having worked both with and for Christina, I have seen her professionalism, sound business judgement, and, most importantly, her willingness to roll up her sleeves and get things done. Christina has invested her own time, energy, and resources in District 5 because she believes deeply in Gilroy, loves our downtown, and its surrounding neighborhoods. She shares my belief that our historic downtown and neighborhoods can once again become the heart and soul of our community and will work hard to preserve and strengthen both\".\nGary Walton\n\"Christina is a breath of fresh air for Gilroy and is the kind of leader needed on the Gilroy City Council. By combining her keen intelligence with a deep understanding of our community’s needs, she brings the energy and vision required to help our families and businesses thrive. She has my full endorsement for a seat on the City Council\"\nMartha Martinez\nRetired Superintendent, active community leader and longtime resident of Gilroy\n## More Coming....\n## Add your name\n## ENDORSE CHRISTINA\n## Add your name\n## ENDORSE CHRISTINA\n## More Coming....\nbottom of page",
